        en: 'Two addresses, the second cwen@iupui.edu, and zero. The zero is deliberate: the pattern \\S+@\\S+ demands one or more non-space characters before the @ — and before @2PM sits a blank space, so the pattern never completes. Notice findall roamed the whole line collecting every match: this is not a yes/no operation but a harvest.',
      },
